"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Interaction patch’s four discrete output ports, or Drag’s momentum + rubber-band"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"physics — Swami ships a helper named after the Origami patch and shaped like it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Corpus (in progress — 2 of 69)","anchor":"Corpus-in-progress-2-of-69","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The translated corpus is the gallery and the training set. Each entry is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verified SwiftUI translation of an Origami pattern."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Interaction","anchor":"Interaction","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"doc:Interaction_Touch"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct